        "subject_definitions: The adult dancer in <Picture 1> is the single subject. <Picture 2> defines the empty rehearsal studio.\n\nsummary: A continuous 5.167-second live-action full-body dance rehearsal with native sound.\n\nretention_analysis: Retain the woman's facial identity, long black hair, black cropped top, pleated skirt and knee-high boots from <Picture 1>. Retain the gray walls, wooden floor and overhead track lighting from <Picture 2>.\n\ndetailed_description: [Shot 1] A fixed eye-level camera keeps her head and both boots visible. The dancer takes two relaxed side steps and moves her forearms outward with open hands. She then brings both feet together, rests her left hand on her hip and raises her right forearm beside her head. Supporting boots plant before each weight transfer. Hair and skirt follow the small movement and settle naturally. Soft frontal and overhead light stays consistent.\n\noverall_soundscape: A steady instrumental beat from the studio speakers, soft boot impacts on wood, quiet room tone and fabric rustle. No spoken dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
